00:16:18.400 --> 00:17:09.740
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Magandang araw sa inyong lahat. Ang testimonya ni Atty. Gerardo F. Del Rosario ay magpapatunay ng mga sumusunod. Una, Ang vicepresidente at ang kanyang asawa na si Atty. Manassas R. Carpio ay may pag-aaring mga kumpanya o negosyo. Kabilang sa mga kumpanyang ito ay ang mga sumusunod. City Hall King Chow Foods Corporation Metro City Chow Foods Corporation GenCorp Industries Inc. CALE88 Foods Corporation Mati City Ice Plant and Cold Storage Geometry, Security and Investigation Agency, Inc., Great Jolly Times Food Corporation, Times Square Bee Foods Corporation,

00:17:11.320 --> 00:18:03.770
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Davao New Royal Taipan Foods Corporation, Davao Emerging Taipans Corporation, Free Kids Trucking Services, Inc., CYKNP Davao Corporation, SGT Fortune Horse Corporation, Davao Bounty Times Food Corporation, Madayaw Fisheries, Inc., Amianan Shores, Inc., Cable II, 88 Shipping and Marine Services, Inc., at Carpio Lawyers. Pangalawa, may mga shares of stock at interest si na Vice President Sara Z. Duterte at ang kanyang asawa na si Atty. Manassas Carpio sa mga kumpanya. Ang halaga ng mga shares of stock at iba pang interest sa mga kumpanya ay dapat i-declare sa SALN.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:54.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pangatlo, base sa mga authentic records ng Securities and Exchange Commission at ng mga kumpanya, papatunayan kung magkano ang kinita ng mga kumpanyang ito at kung may dividends bang dineklara o ipinamahagi sa kanilang mga stockholders. Importante ito dahil gusto nating makita kung ang mga kumpanyang ito ay talagang may naibigay na lahitimong income kay VP Sara Duterte na maaaring makatulong magpaliwanag sa paglaki ng kanyang declared net worth. Ngunit batay sa records na ipapakita, wala o zero ang dividends para kay VP Sara at Atty. Manassas Carpio sa mga kumpanyang ito.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:19:37.200
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pang-apat, ipapakita ng witness ang sariling filings ng mga korporasyon sa SEC? kabilang na ang articles of incorporation or partnership, general information sheets, at iba pang corporate records. Makikita rito kung sino ang incorporators, stockholders, directors, at officers ng bawat korporasyon. At mahalaga, makikita rin kung sa mga panahong Vice President na si Sara Duterte, nakalista pa rin ang kanyang pangalan at interest sa ilang korporasyon. Ito... ay malinaw na paglabag ng konstitusyon.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:20:26.580
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Panglima, ang ilan sa mga kumpanya ni Vice President ay nagreport ng malalaking sales sa mga panahong siya ay Vice President. Isa na sa nagtala ng malalaking sales ay ang GenCorp Industries, Inc. Itong GenCorp Industries ay may kaugnayan kay Vice President, hindi lang dahil ito ay kanyang dineklara sa kanyang SALN. Ang GenCorp Industries at iba pang mga kumpanya ni Vice President ay may mga interlocking shareholders, directors at officers. Isa na dito ay si Jaime T. Cruz. At ang pangalan ni Jaime T. Cruz ay paulit-ulit na lumalabas sa mga SEC documents.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:33.820
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: That's it for

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:36.040
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: the offer of testimony, Your

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:36.200
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Honor.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.850
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Comment, Atty. Justin?

00:20:38.850 --> 00:21:12.770
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Just a few comments, Your Honor, with respect to purpose number one. We would like to object to this as there is a conclusion of ownership, Your Honor. As to purpose number two, Your Honor, and purpose number four, Your Honor, there are conclusions of law again coming from the prosecution. And number five, the mention of this person, Jaime T. Cruz, and the fact that there is an interlocking positions, allegedly, is also irrelevant. Conclusions of Law, Your Honor. Nevertheless, Your Honor, everything is subject to cross-examination.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:18.960
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Duly noted. Atty. Erwin, you may proceed with your direct examination. Thank

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:22.820
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: you, Your Honor. Just a quick manifestation before I begin with my questions, Your Honor.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:27.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed, sir.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:22:18.140
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you. Mr. Presiding Officer and dear Senator-judges, before I begin, I'd like to respectfully beg for the indulgence of the Honorable Impeachment Court. and the Senator-Judges to kindly be patient with my line of questioning for this witness today. As much as I believe that all of the Senator-Judges are well-versed in the technical terms that we will be using today, the viewing public may not be as well-versed. Marami po sa mga terminologies na itidiscussed today. Maaaring first time po marinig ng mga manonood na tulad ng mga dividends, retained earnings, shareholdings, board of directors. So konting pagpapasensya lang po. Kapag nalagpasan po natin yung pag-discuss ng mga terminologies na ito, sa tingin ko po, bibilis ang ating presentation at maaaring hindi ko na isa-isahin pang i-discuss o magtanong tungkol sa bawat kumpanya na na-enumerate kanina.

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:25.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We will let you know when we're getting impatient, counsel. Please proceed. Thank you, Your Honor.

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:32.890
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Good morning, Atty. Del Rosario.

