00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.460
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Kumusta po kayo ngayong araw na ito?

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.290
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Maayos naman po.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:56.580
