02:54:51.120 --> 02:55:46.400
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: This particular statement, number one, open quote, a quick perusal of the document already shows some misrepresentation, close quote. That is the first statement. Second, open quote, clearly, this is again an attempt and apologies to use the term to condition the minds of the public over these figures, close quote. Tingin po namin na, Your Honors, hindi ho ito dapat ginagamit. Particular dahil ito po naman ay aktual na dokumento na isinumite sa atin pong korte ng opisina po na nakaharap po sa atin ngayon. At pangalawa, tumaliman na rin naman po kami doon sa panawagan na tanggalin yung pong meron pong so to speak misleading heading.

02:55:48.490 --> 02:55:49.590
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: sa dokumento pong ito.

