Atty. Sheila C. Sison: Truly, the intention of the prosecution is just to present the documents and the data and information containing those documents, then the simple solution to their problem would have been to just simply refer to the certified through copies of the documents brought today by the witness, Your Honor.

02:56:43.500 --> 02:57:09.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: TSN, counsel, with your indulgence, we will make a ruling later on before we adjourn today's trial. And again, may the chair reiterate from the clerk of court for a copy of the TSN, relevant TSN. Thank you, Atty. Ridon. Atty. Del Rosario, naunawaan niyo po na magpapatuloy po kayong magbigay ng inyong testimonya sa ilalim po ng naunan niyong pinanumpaan ngayong kaninang umaga.

02:57:09.260 --> 02:57:09.740
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

