Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so tapos na tayo sa summary ng Metro City Chow Foods Corporation.

02:57:43.120 --> 02:58:08.220
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ang next na kumpanya po na pag-uusapan natin ngayon ay itong GenCorp Industries Inc., and I believe the summary for this company is on page 5. And may we request the tech booth to flash the summary on the screen for everyone to see.

02:58:30.720 --> 02:58:34.700
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so naka-flash na po itong summary for GenCorp Industries Inc.

02:58:38.830 --> 02:58:46.710
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sir, based po sa documents at sa summary na ito, ano po ba ang negosyo ng GenCorp Industries, Inc.?

02:58:48.570 --> 02:58:58.450
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang GenCorp Industries, Inc., na nairehistro po sa amin noong September 23, 2020, ay mayroong primary purpose na to operate a restaurant.

02:59:01.160 --> 02:59:14.760
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. At lumalabas po, may data from Articles of Incorporation or AOI. Based po sa Articles of Incorporation, ano po ang lumalabas na interest ni VP Sara dito kung mayroon man?

02:59:15.970 --> 02:59:25.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ayon po sa kanyang Articles of Incorporation, hindi po nag-a-appear ang pangalan ni VP Sara Duterte sa kumpanya na ito.

02:59:26.200 --> 02:59:38.360
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you. And sa general information sheet naman po, ano pong nakalagay kung mayroon man tungkol sa interest or shareholding ni Vice President tungkol sa kumpanyang ito?

02:59:39.500 --> 02:59:51.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala rin pong impormasyon na nakalagay sa kanilang General Information Sheet na nagsasabi na si VP Sara Duterte ay director o stockholder ng GenCorp Industries Inc.

03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:03.120
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: From Audited Financial Statements or AFS.

03:00:04.910 --> 03:00:14.710
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Based po sa data na nandito, magkano po yung naging sales nitong GenCorp Industries Inc. para sa taong 2021?

03:00:17.600 --> 03:00:30.600
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Para po sa taong 2021, ayon sa financial statement, ang kanilang sales po ay merong total na PHP 28,087,703.

03:00:34.120 --> 03:00:40.580
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At ano naman po ang mapapansin ninyo sa sales ng kumpanyang ito pagdating ng year 2022?

03:00:43.540 --> 03:00:53.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, noong 2022 po, lumaki po ang kanilang sales from 28 million naging 300 million 23,052 po.

03:00:53.600 --> 03:00:59.860
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so lumaki almost times 10. Tama po ba yung paglaki ng sales ng kumpanyang ito for 2022?

03:01:01.330 --> 03:01:02.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

03:01:04.140 --> 03:01:09.040
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sir, kailan po ulit na-elect si Respondent Sara Duterte as Vice President?

03:01:10.420 --> 03:01:14.460
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nanumpa po siya noong June 30, 2022.

03:01:15.080 --> 03:01:23.480
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, the same year na nagtala ng sales itong kumpanyang to na 300 million pesos, 23,052. Ngayon, punta tayo sa...

03:01:23.480 --> 03:01:30.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. Pardon, we move to strike the additional statements of the counsel, Your Honor. These are conclusions of facts.

03:01:31.100 --> 03:01:32.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly reform, Atty. Erwin.

03:01:32.940 --> 03:01:44.140
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Anyway, I'll go to the next... Or move on. Yes, Your Honor, I'll move on. For the year 2023, magkano po ang naging sales ng GenCorp Industries, Inc.?

03:01:44.870 --> 03:01:51.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: 2023 po, tumaas pa rin po, naging 320,560,702 ang

03:01:54.040 --> 03:01:54.380
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: sales.

03:01:55.910 --> 03:01:59.590
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero nagkaroon po ba ng net income para sa taong yan?

03:02:00.750 --> 03:02:07.690
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa 2023 po meron po siyang net income na 2,700,451.

03:02:07.910 --> 03:02:25.130
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. So from yung sales nila na 320,560,702 ang natira lamang na net income ay 2,700,451. Tama po ba?

03:02:25.990 --> 03:02:28.470
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa financial statement ng kumpanya.

03:02:29.360 --> 03:02:37.980
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, sige po. Ngayon, punta tayo sa 2024. Magkano po ang naging total sales ng kumpanyang ito para sa taong ito?

03:02:39.270 --> 03:02:46.750
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: For 2024 po, ang total sales ay 394,075,361 pesos.

03:02:47.950 --> 03:02:54.810
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: 300,094,070... Sorry, 394 million.

03:02:57.400 --> 03:03:11.520
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: 75,361 ang naging sales. So kung may 365 days po tayo sa isang araw, so average in a day, nakaka more than 1 million po sila na sales para lamang sa taong 2024.

03:03:12.240 --> 03:03:15.040
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. Calls for speculation. Move on,

03:03:15.100 --> 03:03:15.260
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: counsel.

03:03:18.030 --> 03:03:22.470
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Magkano po ang natirang net income ng kumpanyang ito para sa 2024?

03:03:24.010 --> 03:03:31.530
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nung 2024 po merong natirang net income sa halagang 3,324,863 pesos.

03:03:31.870 --> 03:03:55.850
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so 3 million lamang po ang kanilang net income or less para sa taong ito. Pero kung titignan niyo po yung last column, puro no dividends declared. Pero based po sa data dito, maaari po bang, meron po bang... Halaga na maaaring i-declare sana ng kumpanyang ito bilang dividends?

03:03:58.350 --> 03:04:04.250
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Mayroon po sa 2024 mayroon pong figure na nakalagay

03:04:05.760 --> 03:04:10.520
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: sa unappropriated or unrestricted retained earnings na pinagkukunan po ng dividendo.

03:04:10.960 --> 03:04:22.440
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero lahatin na po natin yung tanong na for 2021 hanggang 2024, magkano po ang dineclare na dividends para sa kumpanyang ito kung mayroon man?

03:04:23.500 --> 03:04:34.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po kaming nakitang informasyon mula sa financial statement maging sa GIS na nagkaroon po siya ng deklarasyon sa mga panahong ito from 2021 hanggang 2024.

03:04:34.800 --> 03:04:45.300
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. Pero tignan po natin yung total sales. Meron pong total sales dito para sa 2021 hanggang 2024. Magkano po yung overall total sales nila para sa kumpanyang ito?

03:04:46.840 --> 03:04:58.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung susumahin po yung sales mula 2021 hanggang 2024, Ang total po nito ay 1,042,746,818.

03:04:59.280 --> 03:05:07.020
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So more than 1 billion ang total sales ng kumpanya mula 2021 hanggang 2024.

03:05:08.630 --> 03:05:12.870
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At magkano naman po yung overall net income para sa mga taong ito?

03:05:14.530 --> 03:05:24.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang net income po niya from 2021 hanggang 2024 po. ay may halagang 8,039,201 pesos.

03:05:24.720 --> 03:05:37.120
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so despite having a net income po, no, no, more than 8 million, ang sinasabi niyo po, wala pong dividend declaration para sa kumpanyang ito sa mga nasabing taon.

03:05:37.260 --> 03:05:45.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Again, Your Honor, apologies, we are constrained to move to strike the repetition or additional statements from counsel, Your Honor.

03:05:46.330 --> 03:05:47.490
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: To conclude, your honor, the...

03:05:47.490 --> 03:05:51.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Same ruling, same ruling, counsel. You know it already?

03:05:52.010 --> 03:06:14.610
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. I'll move on to my next point. So, sir, lumalabas po dito sa summary na hindi lumalabas bilang incorporator or director or even as a stockholder si VP Sara sa kumpanyang ito although dineclare niya po sa kanyang SALN itong business interest na ito.

03:06:14.820 --> 03:06:21.640
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. The witness would be incompetent. It's not even aware of the SALN of the Vice President.

03:06:22.340 --> 03:06:23.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Sustained counsel.

03:06:23.620 --> 03:07:10.470
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, I'll reform, Your Honor. I'll just remove that part. So, sir, based po sa summary, lumalabas na wala po si VP Sara bilang incorporator or director at stockholder sa kumpanyang ito. Ngayon, nabanggit niyo po kasi na nag-start kayo magtrabaho sa SEC bilang abogado, 1996 pa. Tama po. So, sa tagal po ng inyong pagtatrabaho sa SEC, may mga sitwasyon na po ba kayong nakita na kung saan ang isang tao, kahit na hindi lumalabas bilang incorporator or shareholder or director ng kumpanya, ay may interest or may control sa kumpanya?

03:07:10.950 --> 03:07:12.730
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Calls for speculation, Your Honor.

03:07:14.330 --> 03:07:15.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Speculative, Your Honor.

03:07:15.690 --> 03:07:18.210
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, we are asking on the basis of experience.

03:07:18.006 --> 03:07:18.830
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If he knows, counsel.

03:07:18.830 --> 03:07:19.190
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you, Your Honor.

03:07:19.290 --> 03:07:21.230
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I have to rule the objection. If he knows, Attorney Del Rosario.

03:07:21.230 --> 03:07:22.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: knows, Attorney Del Rosario.

03:07:24.030 --> 03:07:40.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron pong pagkakataon na nominee ang isang tao, nominee siya ng isang kumpanya na kung saan nire-represent niya yung kumpanya na stockholder sa isang kumpanya. Posible rin po na meron silang trust agreement.

03:07:41.840 --> 03:07:48.000
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: na siya ang muna ang mag-represent ng kanyang interest sa kumpanya. Nangyayari po yan.

03:07:49.930 --> 03:07:57.990
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: When you say siya, may nabanggit po kasi kayo na nominee. At siya, sino po yung siya in relation to the nominee?

03:07:58.410 --> 03:08:05.150
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, yung pong trustee, maaaring siya ang nag-represent ng trustor through a trust agreement.

03:08:06.870 --> 03:08:07.470
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: So

03:08:07.470 --> 03:08:17.720
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: yung trustor po, kahit na hindi lumalabas sa... Listahan yung pangalan niya sa kumpanya, maaaring meron siyang in-appoint na nominee o trustee.

03:08:17.760 --> 03:08:20.700
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pag meron pong ganong dokumento. So

03:08:20.700 --> 03:08:27.120
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: yung trust po, from the root word, trust agreement, trust or trustee, ano po ibig sabihin ng trust na ito?

03:08:27.720 --> 03:08:29.880
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Trust po, ibig sabihin, nagtitiwala.

03:08:31.780 --> 03:08:33.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pinagkatiwalaan at nagtiwala.

03:08:33.580 --> 03:08:39.660
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So dapat may pagtitiwala po sa dalawang tao na nag-a-agree dito sa trust agreement.

03:08:40.200 --> 03:08:42.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Dapat po meron siguro silang dokumento.

03:08:42.540 --> 03:08:46.400
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So itong mga ganitong arrangement, ito po ba ay legal?

03:08:48.660 --> 03:09:06.650
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi naman po siya masasabing illegal. Huwag lamang pong gagamitin sa katiwalian tulad po ng itatago niya ang kanyang personality para maitago yung responsibilidad sa batas.

03:09:09.050 --> 03:09:22.130
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Magbigay nga po kayo ng halimbawa na kung saan may mga ganyang bagay na ginagamit yung trustor or trustee relationship para sa mga iligal na bagay. Base po sa inyong experience o nalalaman?

03:09:22.330 --> 03:09:39.890
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, objection. Yes, Attorney Justin. Two levels. The witness is being presented merely to identify documents from the SEC and he is not being presented by expert. But now the prosecution is asking the witness of hypothetical scenarios, your honor. Surely this cannot be allowed, your honor.

03:09:41.930 --> 03:09:43.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With your indulgence, counsel.

03:09:45.330 --> 03:09:49.610
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Del Rosario, hindi po bawal magkaroon ng trust agreement, di po ba?

03:09:49.750 --> 03:09:51.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po siya bawal.

03:09:51.190 --> 03:09:56.270
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ang trustor po sa isang trust agreement sa yung tunay na may-ari o beneficial owner. Tama po.

03:09:56.430 --> 03:09:57.030
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

03:09:57.340 --> 03:10:04.360
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yung trustee o nominee, siya po yung pinagkatiwalaan ng trustor o tunay na may-ari o beneficial owner. Tama po?

03:10:04.500 --> 03:10:06.680
