03:36:22.640 --> 03:36:24.700
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Counsel from both parties may approach.

03:36:33.710 --> 03:36:45.080
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: For the record, Your Honor, the 2025 GIS of CALE88 Foods Corporation is the prosecution's exhibit P-R2-2-4-4-E.

03:36:49.040 --> 03:36:54.240
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakisabi nga po kung sino na ang lumalabas dyan na shareholders ng Cali 88 Foods Corporation.

03:36:58.700 --> 03:37:40.060
