03:38:24.350 --> 03:38:28.490
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You are supposedly on CALE88 Foods Corporation, right, Counsel?

03:38:29.150 --> 03:38:35.810
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. And we'd like to show the reported shareholders of these companies, Your Honor.

03:38:37.120 --> 03:38:39.920
