03:38:40.120 --> 03:38:40.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Understood, Your Honor.

03:38:42.470 --> 03:38:50.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, Pakilino po, ilan po yung percentage ownership ulit ng Pikimong Pikimong dyan sa CALE88 Foods Corporation para sa taong 2025?

03:38:51.910 --> 03:39:01.810
