03:39:58.090 --> 03:40:09.140
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: On the basis po ng financial statement ng kumpanya ito, meron po siyang net loss amounting to 1,923,037 pesos.

03:40:10.390 --> 03:40:19.250
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: And sa last column po nakalagay pertaining to dividend appropriation slash declaration slash payment.

03:40:20.930 --> 03:40:26.210
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Puro po no dividends declared. So bakit po ulit yan ang nakalagay dyan sa column na iyan?

03:40:27.570 --> 03:40:36.870
