03:43:03.500 --> 03:43:12.780
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: For 2022 po meron na pong nadagdag na advances from stockholders ngayon po ay 18,500,000 pesos na po.

03:43:13.040 --> 03:43:41.510
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay so tumaas po yung 18,500,000 na advances and tignan naman po natin. Yung 2023 comparative financial statements ng kumpanya pa rin, CALE88 Foods Corporation. And Your Honor, we'd like to show to the witness Exhibit P-Roman numeral 2-2-6-4-C.

03:43:43.320 --> 03:43:52.350
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: And Sir, punta po kayo sa page 11. Sorry, page 12 ng dokumentong ibinigay sa inyo.

03:44:08.780 --> 03:44:19.180
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Punta po ulit tayo sa advances from stockholders para sa taong 2023. Magkano na po yung nakalista na advances from stockholders kung mayroon man?

03:44:20.370 --> 03:44:33.680
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: For 2023 po, the financial statement ng CALE88 Foods Corporation, meron pong amount na 20 million pesos as advances from stockholders.

03:44:37.310 --> 03:44:48.330
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Based po sa summary niyo kanina, para sa taong 2022 hanggang 2024, ilan po ang shareholdings ulit ni Atty. Manassas R. Carpio? Ilang porsyento?

03:44:53.410 --> 03:45:01.770
