03:45:32.600 --> 03:45:41.410
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, may we object to this as irrelevant, Your Honor. This is clearly no longer within the scope of the testimony of the witness, Your Honor.

03:45:44.020 --> 03:45:46.220
