03:45:46.520 --> 03:45:57.400
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, we are asking this witness on the basis of his experience, considering that he said that he regularly files his SALN, so this is within his knowledge, and he's also a lawyer, by the way, Your Honor.

03:45:57.640 --> 03:46:06.040
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Both on relevance and competence, counsel, I have to sustain the objection of Atty. Justin. Move on, counsel. You have other points for this witness, I believe.

03:46:08.780 --> 03:46:10.700
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Move on to your next point, Atty. Erwin.

03:46:11.230 --> 03:46:23.070
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Kayo po ba? Kanina pa po natin napag-uusapan ng shares of stock. Kayo po ba meron ding interest sa mga kumpanya or any organization?

03:46:25.210 --> 03:46:25.750
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron po.

03:46:26.730 --> 03:46:31.830
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At ito po ba ay dinedeclare ninyo sa inyong SALN?

03:46:32.110 --> 03:46:35.690
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, apologies. We have to raise the same objection on Your Honor.

03:46:35.870 --> 03:46:38.090
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, on the basis of his experience,

03:46:38.430 --> 03:46:38.650
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your

03:46:38.650 --> 03:46:43.690
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Honor, in filing his own SALN and considering that he was discussing shares of stock earlier.

03:46:44.380 --> 03:47:14.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Pardon, Your Honor. The witness is not being presented here for him to testify about his personal experiences in relation to his SALN. At the offer, Your Honor, he was clearly being offered to identify documents from the SEC. In fact, to abbreviate his proceedings, the defense stipulated that he is competent to do so. But now, it would appear that the prosecution is asking him questions pertaining to his personal life. and his personal experience as a public officer, which makes it clearly irrelevant, Your Honor.

03:47:14.940 --> 03:47:17.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Move to our next point, Atty. Erwin. Please

03:47:17.520 --> 03:47:18.080
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: submit, Your Honor.

03:47:21.000 --> 03:47:31.810
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so puntahan po natin yung isa pang kumpanya na ang pangalan ay Times Square Bee Foods Corporation. I

