03:48:53.400 --> 03:49:08.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang Times Square Bee Foods Corporation na na-register po noong June 24, 2013 ay mayroong primary purpose na to establish, operate, and maintain restaurant, coffee shop, refreshment parlors, cocktail lounges, and catered foods.

03:49:08.740 --> 03:49:13.620
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so pangatlong kumpanya na po noong restaurant ang business.

03:49:17.610 --> 03:49:24.190
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero lumalabas po dito na nakalagay na VP Sara does not appear as incorporator slash director.

03:49:26.710 --> 03:49:27.690
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Tama po.

03:49:30.680 --> 03:50:03.440
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Napansin ko po na may isa pa kayong ginawang summary at ito ay ang summary ng incorporators declared in the AOI merong by company. Tignan nga po natin yung summary na ito at ilabas natin yung portion ng summary tungkol sa incorporators nitong kumpanyang Times Square Bee Foods Corporation.

03:50:20.980 --> 03:50:42.340
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nasa page 5 po ito ng summary. So lumalabas po dyan, merong listahan ng mga incorporators ng Times Square Bee Foods Corporation. Pakitignan nga po sino po yung lumalabas na una. Unang pangalan sa listahan ng Incorporators para sa Times Square Bee Foods Corporation.

03:50:46.680 --> 03:51:01.000
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Para po sa Times Square B Foods Corporation, ang mga Incorporators po niya as declared sa kanyang Articles of Incorporation ay una, isang Ang Hai Peng.

03:51:01.730 --> 03:51:03.930
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ano po ulit? Ano po yung pangalan, Sir?

03:51:04.170 --> 03:51:08.870
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang Hai Peng. Ang Hai Peng.

03:51:09.500 --> 03:51:10.180
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

03:51:11.330 --> 03:51:29.550
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pangalawa? Roxanne T. Ang, Bolly G. Jimenez, Gordon T. Jimenez, Gurly S. Delacruz.

03:51:30.350 --> 03:51:31.510
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, thank you.

03:51:34.950 --> 03:51:44.260
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero based po sa summary ng Times Square B Foods Corporation, may... I withdraw that, Your Honor. Okay, so...

03:51:46.280 --> 03:52:44.570
