Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, wala pong... Dividendo para sa kumpanyang yan. Pakitignan po yung susunod, yung Mati City Ice Plant and Cold Storage Inc. Magkano po ang dineclare na dividends para sa mga taong nag-submit ito ng AFS at GIS? Meron po ba?

03:53:43.670 --> 03:53:47.610
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala pong informasyon kung merong dineclare ng dividendo.

03:53:47.950 --> 03:53:49.270
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, wala pa rin ho.

03:53:51.100 --> 03:54:18.660
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So... Next company, Geometry Security and Investigation Agency Inc., magkano po ang dineklara na dividends para sa mga taong nagsubmit ito ng GIS at AFS? Wala pong nadeklarang dividendo. Wala pa rin. Para naman po sa Great Jolly Times Food Corporation, magkano po ang dineklara na dividends para sa mga taong nagsubmit ito ng AFS at GIS?

03:54:19.790 --> 03:54:24.690
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala rin pong nadeclare ang dividendo rito sa Great Jolly Times Food Corporation.

03:54:27.110 --> 03:54:36.830
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Times Square Bee Foods Corporation, magkano po ang dineclare na dividends para sa mga taong nagsubmit ito ng GIS at Audited Financial Statements?

03:54:38.100 --> 03:54:44.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: For Times Square B Food Corporation, wala rin pong dividendo sa kumpanya ito.

03:54:45.930 --> 03:54:59.160
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So Great Jolly Times Food Corp, wala. Pati ang Times Square B Foods Corp, wala din po. Susunod, Davao New Royal Taipan Foods Corporation, magkano po ang dineclare na dibidendo?

03:55:00.210 --> 03:55:04.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala pong dibidendong dineclare para sa Davao New Royal Taipan Foods Corporation.

03:55:05.650 --> 03:55:12.070
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Para naman, sa Davao Emerging Taipans Corporation, magkano po ang dineclare na dibidendo?

03:55:13.170 --> 03:55:17.830
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Para po sa Davao Emerging Taipan Corporation, wala rin pong nadeclare ng dibidendo.

03:55:18.070 --> 03:55:42.210
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, pardon, before the... The questioning of the opposing counsel continues. We will have to object to the flashing of this document being flashed on the screen as I do not believe this is the summary prepared by the witness, Your Honor. And thus, the witness cannot identify or authenticate this purported summary, which again, is being flashed by the prosecution.

03:55:42.890 --> 03:55:52.060
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, this is our presentation. It's just a way to shorten and Present it in a very understandable manner, Your Honor.

03:55:52.220 --> 03:56:11.820
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: No, Your Honor. The witness, apologies, but we will not let this go. That is not a presentation, that is a prop. And the problem with that, Your Honor, is it contains information from documents which the witness should identify themselves. Now, if they want those figures to be reflected... It should come from the documents and from the testimony of the witness.

03:56:33.330 --> 03:56:54.930
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The counsel is simply summarizing it in order for, rather for clarity of presentation. And that is how the court is taking it. As a mere illustration and summary of what the witnesses thus far testified on pertaining to declared dividends or the absence thereof. I would have to overrule the objection, Attorney Justine. You may proceed, counsel.

03:56:55.170 --> 03:57:00.150
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor. But before the counsel proceeds, Your Honor, we will have to record our continuing objection, Your Honor.

03:57:14.850 --> 03:57:28.450
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ang huling nabanggit po ay itong Davao Emerging Taipans Corporation at wala pong dividends na dineklara. Ang susunod na kumpanya, Three Kids Trucking Services Incorporated.

03:57:30.560 --> 03:57:36.700
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Magkano po ang dineclare na dividends? Para sa mga taong nagsubmit ito ng GIS at Audited Financial Statements?

03:57:38.360 --> 03:57:42.120
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Para po sa Three Kids Trucking Services, wala

03:57:50.660 --> 03:57:51.040
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: rin po.

03:57:54.890 --> 03:58:06.610
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, 6 na lang po. Baka naman may lumabas sa 6 na natitirang kumpanya. Pakitignan po ang CYK&T Davao Corporation. Magkano po ang dineclare na dividends kung mayroon man?

