Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa CYKNT Davao Corporation, wala pong information dahil wala silang AFS na sirbit sa SEC.

03:58:13.730 --> 03:58:20.190
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, thank you. How about SGT Fortune Horse Corporation? Magkano po ang dineclare kung mayroon man?

03:58:23.160 --> 03:58:27.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa SGT Fortune Horse Corporation, wala rin pong nadeclare ng dividendo.

03:58:28.410 --> 03:58:37.210
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you. Last four companies. Davao Bounty Times Food Corporation. Magkano po ang dineclare na dividends kung mayroon man?

03:59:13.620 --> 03:59:14.420
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sandali lang po.

03:59:33.050 --> 03:59:42.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang Davao Bounty Times Food Corporation po ay Wala pong nasubmit sa FS kaya wala pong information sa pagdideklaro ng dividendo.

04:00:00.000 --> 04:00:27.740
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: The information that should be contained is no information, not no dividend declared. This is precisely our objection to this because this is misleading. Just because a company did not file does not mean that no dividends was declared, Your Honor. If the prosecution, if so minded, intends to be accurate, they should have put in that supposed summary or prop that there was no information, not no dividends declared as it appears now.

04:00:30.040 --> 04:00:33.000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Del Rosario, care to elucidate?

04:00:33.380 --> 04:00:41.780
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ang nakalagay po sa aking dokumento ay no AFS filed with the SEC. Kaya walang information kung meron po o wala.

