04:20:07.190 --> 04:20:11.930
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: 2019, ah, stockholder pa po si VP Sara.

04:20:12.230 --> 04:20:17.870
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pero nung nag-submit sila ng amended GIS

04:20:17.870 --> 04:20:20.540
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: nung 2019 hanggang 2021, hindi na po siya, ah, stockholder o director.

04:20:46.670 --> 04:20:47.630
