04:20:47.630 --> 04:20:52.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Horse Corporation.

04:20:52.970 --> 04:20:54.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Incorporator po siya no'ng

04:20:55.990 --> 04:20:56.750
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: 2013.

04:20:56.750 --> 04:21:01.290
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ah, hindi na po siya lumalabas as director o stockholder.

04:21:01.290 --> 04:21:03.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa reporting po nila, hindi na po siya part ng kumpanya.

04:21:03.970 --> 04:21:04.730
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: But

04:21:04.730 --> 04:21:11.930
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: 'Yung particular na dokumentong nagsasabi na tina-transfer niya 'yung kanyang ownership to other person, wala po kaming, ah, pinanghawakang gano'n.

04:21:14.440 --> 04:21:21.160
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Parte po do'n sa hindi na siya director o stockholder sa City Hall Kinchiao, 2019 to 2021.

04:21:22.960 --> 04:21:28.100
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Meron po bang dokumentong nagpapakita tina-transfer niya 'yung interest niya do'n or wala rin po?

04:21:28.460 --> 04:21:32.740
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po. Based lang po sa information na nakasaad sa kanilang GIS nung panahon na ito.

04:21:36.340 --> 04:21:37.020
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So,

04:21:37.020 --> 04:21:53.360
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: sa dalawang itong kumpanya, sa GIS lamang po medyo made-deduce na nag-divest na siya sa dalawang korporasyong ito. Pero 'yung kung may dagdag pang proseso o dokumento na isusumite sa SEC, wala po kayong natanggap na gano'n.

04:21:53.580 --> 04:21:55.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. 'Yung impormasyon lang po sa GIS.

04:21:56.750 --> 04:22:11.990
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: And lastly po, Atty. del Rosario. Sa iba pang mga kumpanyang pinag-usapan kanina, bukod dito sa City Hall King Chow at 'yung SGT Fortune Corporation, wala pong indikasyon kahit po sa GIS na wala na 'yung kaniyang pangalan

04:22:11.990 --> 04:22:17.810
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: sa mga later years. Wala na pong indikasyon na nag-divest si VP Duterte

04:22:17.810 --> 04:22:21.030
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: sa alinman sa iba pang mga kumpanyang pinag-usapan kanina.

04:22:21.650 --> 04:22:22.670
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, kung hindi na po nakalista

04:22:22.670 --> 04:22:25.790
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ang pangalan niya, 'yun na po ang parang presumption na hindi na siya

04:22:25.790 --> 04:22:26.130
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: kasama do'n.

04:22:26.700 --> 04:22:35.660
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay. Presumption, pero wala pong naisumit na, ah, 'yung binanggit ninyong dokumento na kailangang isumite para ipakita at i-document 'yung pag-divest.

04:22:35.840 --> 04:22:41.520
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala pong deed o anumang dokumentong nagsasabi na tina-transfer niya 'yung kanyang ownership sa ibang tao.

04:22:42.160 --> 04:22:45.800
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay. Maraming salamat po, Atty. del Rosario. Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

04:22:45.820 --> 04:22:50.860
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator-Judge Hontiveros. Senator-Judge Villanueva is recognized. You have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

04:22:51.060 --> 04:22:53.660
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer, Senate President.

04:22:55.620 --> 04:23:12.160
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Atty. del Rosario, sa SALN po ng respondent, uh, dineklara po niya

04:23:12.160 --> 04:23:13.120
Sen. Joel Villanueva: stockholder siya ng GenCorp Industries mula 2013. Sa SEC record po na inyong pinanghawakan, meron po bang nagpapakita o nagpapatunay ng naturang shareholding?

04:23:15.590 --> 04:23:25.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa articles of incorporation ng GenCorp, maging po sa mga subsequent filings po niya ng GIS,

04:23:25.200 --> 04:23:26.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: hindi po nag-appear 'yung pangalan ni VP Sara Duterte sa kumpanyang ito.

04:23:56.800 --> 04:23:58.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: SALN ni VP Sara Duterte.

04:23:57.690 --> 04:24:03.930
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po namin alam 'yung mga allegation niya kung ano-anong mga kumpanya na siya ay may ownership. Kami lang po ay

04:24:03.930 --> 04:24:13.910
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: nagre-rely sa mga dokumentong nakatago sa aming opisina. Kagaya nga po nitong, ah, GenCorp na ito, kung ano lang po ang nasasaad dito, 'yun lamang po ang aming

04:24:13.910 --> 04:24:18.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: sinasabing totoo na si VP ay hindi part ng kumpanya na ito.

04:24:19.650 --> 04:24:29.100
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Ngunit sa inyo pong, ah, pananaw, ano po 'yung dokumento na maaaring mag-reconcile sa SALN sa deklarasyon po niya sa mga corporate records?

04:24:30.850 --> 04:24:38.170
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, kung meron po siguro siyang tinatago o meron po siyang binigyan ng, ah, kumbaga ng binanggit ko po ngayon, may

04:24:38.170 --> 04:24:43.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: trust agreement siya na ikaw muna mag-represent sa akin, maaari po. Pero hindi po namin, wala po kaming

04:24:43.810 --> 04:24:46.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: dokumentong nagsasabi na merong gano'ng

04:24:46.190 --> 04:24:47.180
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: usapan.

04:24:47.180 --> 04:24:47.580
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Posible

04:24:47.580 --> 04:25:02.400
Sen. Joel Villanueva: po ba na ang isang tao ay hindi nakapangalan bilang registered stockholder? Pero 'yung nga po binabanggit niyo, meron po bang ganoong direct or indirect beneficial ownership o control sa isang korporasyon?

04:25:03.180 --> 04:25:27.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ah, nangyayari po 'yan. Kaya nga po minabuti namin na magkaroon kami ng tinatawag na beneficial ownership data information form nang sa ganoon ay malaman natin kung sino ang ultimate beneficial owner ng isang kumpanya. Maiwasan natin 'yung mga circuitous na layering para itago ang personality nung tao na 'yon. Ah, kaya nga po meron na

04:25:27.220 --> 04:25:28.800
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: tayong BO forms.

04:25:36.190 --> 04:25:49.870
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ah, gusto lang pong itala doon kung ikaw ay merong 20% ownership sa isang kumpanya, eh dapat mong ilagay kung sino ang ultimate beneficial owner nung shares of stock na 'yon.

04:25:49.870 --> 04:25:57.810
Sen. Joel Villanueva: At sa inyo pong opisina sa SEC, sa mga dokumentong nasa inyo, mayroon po bang disclosure na

04:26:00.000 --> 04:26:04.560
Sen. Joel Villanueva: nagtuturo kay, ah, ito ho, ah, tukuyin na po natin itong Gen Corp Industries. Meron po

04:26:04.560 --> 04:26:13.140
Sen. Joel Villanueva: ba na nagtuturo kay VP Sara bilang direct o indirect beneficial owner ng Gen Corp Industries? Kung pag-uusapan po

04:26:13.140 --> 04:26:17.720
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: natin 'yung BO forms, ah, wala po, wala

04:26:17.720 --> 04:26:23.920
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po akong access. Ang departamento ko po ay walang access sa dokumento na 'yon kaya hindi ko po kayang sagutin.

04:26:24.710 --> 04:26:26.710
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So not necessarily wala?

04:26:27.210 --> 04:26:28.930
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo. Hindi po wala

04:26:28.930 --> 04:26:30.250
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po kaming alam sa mga dokumentong

04:26:30.250 --> 04:26:33.150
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: nakapaloob sa BO dahil hindi po kami ang

04:26:33.150 --> 04:26:34.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: naghahawak nito.

04:26:34.890 --> 04:26:47.170
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Mula ho 2022, may dokumento po ba sa SEC na nagpapakitang personal na nakilahok o nag-participate si VP sa pamamahala o transaksyon ng anumang mga korporasyon?

04:26:48.320 --> 04:26:49.800
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po. Malibang nga lang po na

04:26:49.800 --> 04:26:53.140
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: nag-appear ang pangalan niya at kung

04:26:53.140 --> 04:26:56.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: direktor po siya sa JS lang. Other than

04:26:56.980 --> 04:26:57.680
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: that, wala na po kaming impormasyon.

04:26:58.040 --> 04:27:06.680
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So kung meron po, anong capacity ang nakalagay? Stockholder, director, beneficial owner, authorized representative o iba pa ho?

04:27:07.460 --> 04:27:19.850
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa kanya pong GIS, nag-a-appear po na siya ay director, siya ay executive member ng executive compensation committee, shareholder. 'Yun lamang po.

04:27:20.610 --> 04:27:33.390
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Kaya nga po ito 'yung tanong ho natin dahil gusto ho nating malaman, meron ho bang nagpapatunay na merong personal participation ang pangalawang pangulo sa corporate acts dito po sa mga kumpanya na ito?

04:27:34.730 --> 04:27:45.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po kaming dokumento on that. 'Yung kanyang attendance, 'yung kanyang participation sa mga activities o meetings ng board of directors ng kumpanya, wala po kaming copy niyan.

04:27:45.149 --> 04:27:45.150
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Kung

04:27:45.150 --> 04:28:03.390
Sen. Joel Villanueva: ganoon nga po, sir, kung wala po kayong ganoong dokumento mula sa SEC record, masasabi po ba nating walang participation o ang masasabi lamang po natin ay walang participation na reflected sa SEC filings na inyo pong sinuri?

04:28:04.670 --> 04:28:08.710
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ah, tulad po ng sinabi ko, kami po ay nagre-rely lamang sa lahat ng nakasulat

04:28:08.710 --> 04:28:11.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: sa dokumento. And

04:28:11.110 --> 04:28:11.410
Sen. Joel Villanueva: the

04:28:11.410 --> 04:28:12.850
Sen. Joel Villanueva: document says wala po siya roon

04:28:12.850 --> 04:28:13.790
Sen. Joel Villanueva: sa

04:28:13.790 --> 04:28:14.410
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Gen Corp.

04:28:14.510 --> 04:28:14.970
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po. Thank you very

04:28:14.970 --> 04:28:16.910
Sen. Joel Villanueva: much. Thank you, Mr. President.

04:28:17.030 --> 04:28:21.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Villanueva. The Senate President is recognized. Senator Gatchalian.

04:28:21.350 --> 04:28:24.790
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Good afternoon, Atty. del Rosario. Good

04:28:24.790 --> 04:28:25.010
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: afternoon.

04:28:25.670 --> 04:28:26.190
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ah, susundan ko lang

04:28:26.190 --> 04:28:31.130
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: po 'yung mga tanong ni Senator Joel Villanueva. Ah, halos

04:28:31.130 --> 04:28:31.210
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: pareho po 'yung

04:28:31.210 --> 04:28:34.270
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: aming, ah, iniisip sa tanong.

04:28:36.610 --> 04:28:57.390
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Um, 'yung kanina ho nakita ko sa inyong presentation or presentation, inyong summary, ah, dito sa City Hall King Chow Foods Corporation from 2017 to 2019, ah, nakasulat dito, ah, si VP Sara ay member/compensation committee.

04:28:59.060 --> 04:28:59.840
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

04:29:00.300 --> 04:29:01.480
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ano ho ibig sabihin nito?

04:29:02.340 --> 04:29:08.420
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, nakalagay po sa kanilang GIS na isinubmit sa amin ng corporate secretary

04:29:08.420 --> 04:29:11.840
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: na siya po ay member ng compensation committee.

04:29:13.490 --> 04:29:20.570
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung sa akin pong pagkakaalam, bilang member ng compensation committee,

04:29:20.570 --> 04:29:31.010
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ah, as part ng executive committee, isa ka pang member ng directors at meron kang mahalagang project na aralin, suriin 'yung mga compensation package ng kumpanya.

04:29:32.200 --> 04:29:41.200
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So ito ay isang, ah, masasabi ba natin, ah, participating in the management of the company?

04:29:42.540 --> 04:29:59.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, kung titignan po natin ang definition ng ganitong uri ng tawag po natin na position executive committee, maaari pong sabihin natin na meron siyang participation.

04:30:08.660 --> 04:30:14.660
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ibig sabihin meron siyang direct participation in the management operations of the company.

04:30:15.440 --> 04:30:20.500
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung pagbabasihan po natin yung title niya rito sa Executive Committee, meron po.

04:30:20.820 --> 04:30:34.820
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yung mga ganitong positions, meron ba kayong nakitang ganyan na position? During her tenure as vice president in any of the companies.

04:30:39.630 --> 04:30:59.110
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Kasi nakita ko dito sa City Hall King Chow until 2019 lang. Based on your summary. But in other corporations, meron ba kayong nakitang parehong merong direct or indirect executive or participation in the operations?

04:30:59.710 --> 04:31:02.730
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Dito po sa Metro City Chow Food Corporation,

04:31:06.110 --> 04:31:17.120
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Lumalabas po for 2025. Si BP Sara Duterte po ay member pa rin po ng Board of Directors. Siya po ay member ng Compensation Committee.

04:31:17.740 --> 04:31:28.820
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So dito po sa Metro City Chow Foods, based on your summary rin, from 2024 to 2025, ganun rin, members-compensation committee. Tama

04:31:28.820 --> 04:31:29.040
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po.

04:31:29.180 --> 04:31:35.240
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So in other words, merong direct... Participation siya in the management of the corporation.

04:31:37.650 --> 04:31:39.790
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa report ng corporate secretary.

04:31:40.370 --> 04:31:57.850
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ayon sa report. Is this, base po sa inyong experience, posible bang violation to ng Article VII, Section 13 of the Constitution? Kasi nakasulat po dito, bawal po yung participate in any business.

04:32:00.210 --> 04:32:00.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

04:32:01.170 --> 04:32:06.250
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So may violation po in this? May violation dito sa Article 7, Section 13.

04:32:06.510 --> 04:32:23.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang sinayay po kasi ay huwag kang magkaroon ng ibang opisina. You should not hold office, employment, at engage in other profession habang ikaw ay during the term of office, even to participate.

04:32:26.200 --> 04:32:40.900
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ito ba ay nakita ko sa inyong mandato kasama sa powers ninyo to... Issue of show-cause order, imposed sanctions. Ito ba naimbestigahan ng SEC as a possible violation of the Constitution?

04:32:41.930 --> 04:32:45.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po namin naimbestigahan yung mga bagay na ganito.

04:32:45.230 --> 04:32:47.670
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero meron po kayong kapangyarihan na imbestigahan?

04:32:48.340 --> 04:32:55.860
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: On violations po ng securities. Pero hindi pa po tungkol sa on whether may violations.

04:32:57.630 --> 04:33:07.510
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pag-perform ng ating opisyalis ng acts na in violation of the Constitution, hindi pa po ako naka-encounter ng ganung issue sa aming opisina.

04:33:07.670 --> 04:33:10.310
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero ito po ay tingin niyo sakop po ng inyong mandato?

04:33:11.180 --> 04:33:26.950
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, kung ang ibig po bang sabihin ng participation is ay mag-join, ay may violation na, siguro po it's the Senate po ang bahalang mag-usga. Talagang mayroong violation.

04:33:27.830 --> 04:33:31.910
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tatanong po ako dun sa isang tanong ni Sen. Joel yung sa trustee.

04:33:33.470 --> 04:33:54.710
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Kung meron pong, kasi nasabi po kanina at tinitignan po namin na yung GenCorp naka-declare sa SALN pero wala po sa corporation. Ano po ang posibleng nangyari po dito? Base po sa inyong experience dahil matagal na rin po kayo sa SEC.

04:34:03.460 --> 04:34:12.340
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Nasa SALN ho siya pero wala ho sa Articles of Incorporation at sa GIS.

04:34:17.040 --> 04:34:21.790
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Bas po sa experience, anong posibleng interpretation ho?

04:34:22.900 --> 04:34:42.460
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, posibleng puro na kung ang GenCorp ay merong isang corporate subscriber na kung saan siya po yung controlling, may controlling interest sa corporate subscriber na yan, maaaring siya na rin po ang gumagawa ng control doon sa GenCorp kung meron pong ganong senaryo. I-check ko lang po yung JS niya.

04:34:42.520 --> 04:34:42.940
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Sige po.

04:34:50.760 --> 04:34:58.420
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, lumalabas po rito, merong itong corporate subscriber, si JTC Group of Companies, na

04:35:02.580 --> 04:35:10.020
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: lumalabas nga po, siya po ay merong 55, almost 55% equity sa nasabing

04:35:11.570 --> 04:35:38.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kumpanya. Yung binabangkit ko pong example, maaaring ang may-ari ng JTC, well, kung ay si VP Sara, para magkaroon siya ng control dito sa GenCorp na kung saan hindi mag-a-appear yung pangalan niya. Yan po, isang senaryo kung talagang siya ay may control ng JTC. Lumalabas po siya po yung nag-exercise ng control parang indirect through the subscriber company.

04:35:38.830 --> 04:35:41.210
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yun yung sinasabi niyong may trust agreement?

04:35:43.690 --> 04:36:11.710
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi na po kayo na kailangan ng trust agreement kung meron silang subscription. Kung mapapakita na stockholder ka o controlling stockholder ka ng JTC, there's no need for trust agreement. Siguro po yung trust agreement kung totally wala man lang corporate subscriber dito, then out from nowhere biglang naging diniclare niya as part ng sale niya, baka meron po siyang kausap dito under trust agreement. kung sino mabuman dito.

04:36:11.790 --> 04:36:19.430
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Last question, Mr. Presiding Officer. Paano niyo po madedetect kung may trust agreement o wala? Para malaman sino talagang beneficial owner.

04:36:20.730 --> 04:36:24.990
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, nasa report po niya sa kanyang BO forms. Pero kung

04:36:24.990 --> 04:36:26.490
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: hindi nakadeclare doon?

04:36:26.690 --> 04:36:42.820
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po akong, hindi po namin, wala po, hindi po siya required ng opisya namin na mag-submit ng ganong dokumento. Maaring kung may trust agreement, dapat isubmit siguro sa corporate secretary para At least sumaerper sa kailangang stock and transfer book. So

04:36:42.820 --> 04:36:43.140
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: voluntary?

04:36:44.610 --> 04:36:45.010
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

04:36:45.450 --> 04:36:46.950
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Voluntary. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

04:36:47.550 --> 04:37:06.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you. Next to make his interjections would be, is rather, Senator-Judge Erwin Tulfo. You're recognized, sir. You may proceed when you're ready. Thereafter, Senator-Judge Bam Aquino, and then we shall adjourn for the day and continue with the interjections of the other senators after the cross-examination of the council for respondents.

04:37:06.360 --> 04:37:09.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: You may proceed, sir. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Mr. Witness,

04:37:10.820 --> 04:37:28.060
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Bawal po ba sa mga mayor, vice mayor magkaroon ng negosyo, maging board of director ng isang kumpanya? Is it? Or tanging ang mga presidente, vice-presidente at cabinet secretaries lang ang hindi po pwede?

04:37:29.630 --> 04:37:34.510
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Alam ko po meron din po siyang prohibition o sa ating local government code.

04:37:37.290 --> 04:37:47.950
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: tungkol po sa mga chief executives na kung saan magkaroon sila ng negosyo at yung kanilang city o municipality ang nagbibigay ng permiso para magnegosyo.

04:37:48.470 --> 04:38:03.030
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright. My next question, sir, is when VP Sara, nakita ninyo yung pangalan niya when she filed po dito sa dokumento ninyo sa SEC, nandoon po yung mga names ng mga companies nila.

04:38:05.450 --> 04:38:34.680
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Hindi niyo ba binalikan nung naging Vice President na po siya? Hindi niyo niyo binalikan siya at para to remind her? Or na hindi niyo ba ninyo trabaho yun? Whose job is it to remind that official na, Sir, Ma'am, baka may violation po kayo, may violation po kayo dito sa filings ninyo, baka kailangan na ninyo mag-divest. You don't do that? You don't remind the official? Hindi po, Your Honor. Why is that?

04:38:35.660 --> 04:39:03.130
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala sa mandato ninyo? Kasi po, wala naman po kaming natatanggap na direktiba sa tatlong sangay ng gobyerno, from the executive, legislative, and judiciary, na kung merong mga personality na nagnegosyo o nagtayo ng kumpanya during the spirit of their term of office, i-report. Wala po eh. Kaya po namin gawin yun kung talaga may direktiba sa amin, i-report namin at kangina namin i-report.

04:39:03.980 --> 04:39:42.350
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: You don't have to report, but to remind that government official, for example, a mayor may negosyo siya dun sa kanyang jurisdiction. Mayor, bawal po ito. Baka malay natin hindi niya alam. Or because marami ng trabaho. For example, like, sige, case in point, VP Sara, baka, so overwhelming yung trabaho niya. May mga accountant siya, may mga lawyer siya, na she was expecting it. They will do something about it. They will inform her. Wala ho. I mean, or kayo mismo. I mean, looking at nasa pangalawang pinakamataas na posisyon po siya sa pamahalaan na it's a

04:39:42.350 --> 04:39:56.050
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: violation, hindi mo man lang po siya na-remind like, Ma'am, or call her attention. Hindi ko kailangan ninyo i-report. To just call the attention of the officer na there's a violation, sir, ma'am. You don't do that.

04:39:56.470 --> 04:40:05.570
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po. Siguro po para mas maging proactive, gawa po ng aming registration ngayon ay totally automated na po siya.

04:40:07.160 --> 04:40:59.380
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala na pong interaction sa processor at yung applicant. Siguro po baka maglagay na lang po kami para lang po matuganan itong sitwasyon na ito ng let's say video materials na sinasabi na please observe Yung batas na ito para sa mga opisyalis na tignan nyo kung kayo ay qualified to put up a company, especially to a stock corporation, iwasan magtayo ng kumpanya para maiwasan din yung conflict of interest. Siguro po pwede po namin gawin yun bilang part ng aming campaign, programa na para maiwasan na nga rin po yung ganito at maging aware sila. Sa mga dapat hindi nila ginagawa.

04:41:21.370 --> 04:41:26.690
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Maulit itong mga ganitong eksena, sitwasyon in the future? Pupwede ko kaya yun, Sir?

04:41:26.930 --> 04:41:37.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Isa-suggest ko po sa aming Commission en banc yung tungkol po sa sinabi niyong maganda naman pong rekomendasyon nito. Thank you, Mr. Witness.

04:41:38.140 --> 04:41:39.200
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Presiding Officer, thank you.

04:41:39.380 --> 04:41:45.100
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Erwin. Senator-Judge Bam Aquino is recognized. You have two minutes, Sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

04:41:46.510 --> 04:42:21.190
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Gandang araw, Attorney Del Rosario. Magandang araw po. Sir, yung mga tanong ko ay tungkol sa dalawang kumpanya. Si Metro City Chow Foods at si GenCorp Industries. Si Metro City Chow Foods po, claro po na merong pagmamayari si Vice President Sara Duterte. Tama po ba? Tama po. Okay. At 20% or one-fifth of the company. Tama po yun. Tama po. Okay. Dito po sa isa, si GenCorp. Hindi po malinaw na meron siyang pagmamayari? O ano ba dyan? Pakiexplain. Kasi wala siya sa GIS, ano?

04:42:21.970 --> 04:42:37.180
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po nag-appear ang pangalan niya bilang incorporator, director, stockholder nung ito pong kumpanya na ito ay natayo. At hindi rin po nag-appear ang pangalan niya sa mga sumunod na dokumentong isinusumitin ng kumpanya, kagaya po ng GIS.

04:42:37.920 --> 04:42:43.500
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pero lumabas po ito sa SALN. Kaya po ba siya nandito? Tama po ba?

04:42:44.210 --> 04:42:51.260
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kaya po siya nandito, gawa po ng kasama po siya sa sulat na nirequest sa amin. Pero wala po akong idea if

04:42:51.260 --> 04:42:51.300
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: it's part.

04:42:51.300 --> 04:42:58.300
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Let me ask the prosecution team. Yung GenCorp kasama dito dahil nasa SALN nito ni VP Sara, tama po?

04:42:58.300 --> 04:43:02.800
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. For the years 2024 and 2025, two

04:43:02.800 --> 04:43:06.740
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: times. Pero hindi po natin alam kung anong prosyento niyan yung pagmamayari ni Vice President Sara?

04:43:06.960 --> 04:43:08.920
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala pong informasyon tungkol doon. Okay.

04:43:09.080 --> 04:43:18.930
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So nakapagtatakalan po kasi, yung dalawang kumpanyang ito, Yung kita po nila o net income is less than 1% ng kanilang sales.

04:43:20.450 --> 04:44:15.690
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Assuming po na restaurant business ito, usually yung mga restaurant business na fast food, ang kanilang net income is about 6% to 8%. Pero yung registered po na net income dito is less than 1%. Kumbaga ang sinasabi nilang kita ay mas maliit pa sa 1% ng buong sales. Kunyari, dito po sa Metro City, For 2025, 35 million yung sales, 200,000 lang yung kita. Dito naman po sa isa, sa GenCorp, in 2024, 394 million ang sales, pero 3 million lang yung kita. Less than 1%, napakaliit. Kaya talagang walang dibidendo po yan kasi ang liit lang. Now, usually po kasi ang ginagawa ng mga negosyo, kung merong pagmamayari, Ayon nilang magdibidendo, binibigyan nila ng sweldo yung kanilang sarili. Bawal po ba yun? Yung may-ari ay mayroong ring sweldo? Hindi naman po, di ba?

04:44:16.250 --> 04:44:37.880
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron pong provision ng ating RCC na kung walang provision, kung walang compensation nakasaad sa articles o bylaws, hindi po pwede magbigay sa mga direktor. Pero maaari siyang makatanggap ng reasonable per diem, pero meron pa rin po siyang limit na hindi lalagpas po ng 10%. Net profit po.

04:44:38.100 --> 04:44:49.640
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So sinasabi po ninyo, yung owner, kung wala akong dividendo, ang siya lang paraan para makakuha ng kita mula sa kumpanya ay per diem?

04:44:50.370 --> 04:44:51.950
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung director din po siya.

04:44:52.210 --> 04:44:53.210
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Kung director and

04:44:53.210 --> 04:44:56.140
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: owner? Kung stockholder director po siya.

04:44:56.300 --> 04:45:05.150
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So kung stricto po tayo, kung ikaw po yung owner ng isang kumpanya, kikita ka lang sa dividendo? Opo. Any other way that

04:45:05.150 --> 04:45:09.260
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: you can earn? From this. Maari po kung ikaw ay empleyado.

04:45:09.800 --> 04:45:12.800
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pwede ko ba kayong empleyado at mayari?

04:45:13.540 --> 04:45:15.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pwede naman po. Wala naman pong restriction.

04:45:16.040 --> 04:45:33.360
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So ang tanong ko po sa prosecution, meron ba kayong detailed financial records ng Metro City at ng GenCorp para malaman kung naging empleyado rin si Manases Carpio or si Sara Duterte Carpio sa mga kumpanyang ito?

04:45:34.350 --> 04:45:41.610
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At least for the SEC records po for today, wala pong kaming nakita na information kung empleyado po sila. In fact,

04:45:41.690 --> 04:45:45.330
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: yung mga empleyado ay wala naman talaga sa SEC records.

04:45:45.730 --> 04:45:46.470
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor.

04:45:46.610 --> 04:46:15.980
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so ang tanong ko, kasi gusto natin malaman eh, kumita ba si Vice President Sara at si Mans Carpio sa mga kumpanyang ito? Lumalabas walang dividendo. Gusto nating malaman rin kung kumita ba sila in another way. So, paano natin malalaman yan kung walang detailed financial records? Or kung meron po ba yung kita, lalabas po ba yan sa income tax ninyo? Kunyari po, empleyado kayo at may kita kayo sa isang kumpanya, dapat po ba lumabas yan sa tax records natin?

04:46:17.470 --> 04:46:20.630
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Dapat po. Kasi doon po ang basehan ng pagbayad niyang buwis.

04:46:20.810 --> 04:46:46.520
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so that's another way. Yung isa po, detailed financial records ng mga kumpanya para malaman kung merong kinita. Yung pangalawa, pag inanalyze yung income tax, Kung may kinita ka, dapat nandun din yun. Tama po ba, sir? Tama po. Okay. Do we have any of these records to the prosecution? Para lang nakakasunod kami dito sa mga pangyayari. Do we have those records? Do we have the income tax records? Do we have the detailed financial records of these companies?

04:46:47.100 --> 04:46:58.280
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: For this, Your Honor, we will be presenting representatives from the BIR to testify on the annual income tax returns of the Vice President and also for the companies, Your Honor.

04:46:58.340 --> 04:47:14.360
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so last question, Mr. Presiding Officer. So kung meron po tayong kinita mula sa mga kumpanyang ito na hindi po dividendo, ibig sabihin ito po yung salary, or meron po tayong kinitang emolument, ay dapat po lumabas ito sa ating income tax record. Tama po ba, Atty. Del Rosario? Dapat po. Okay, thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

04:47:14.940 --> 04:47:22.450
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Before the last, Senator-Judge, just to clarify, Atty. Del Rosario, taxable po ba sa pagkakaalam niyo ang per diem?

04:47:24.210 --> 04:47:27.990
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Siguro po, subject po, kung alam ko po, ay subject ito ng final tax.

04:47:29.810 --> 04:47:33.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Pangalawa, yung sweldo po, withheld na po yan at sourced, di po ba?

04:47:33.530 --> 04:47:35.050
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo. Pangatlo,

04:47:35.070 --> 04:47:42.380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: sinasabi niyong kung empleyado siya, you also meant kung officer siya ng korporasyon, hindi naman simple empleyado lang.

04:47:42.820 --> 04:47:47.640
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo, maaari pong siya ay ang CPA, accountant, hindi

04:47:47.640 --> 04:47:47.900
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: na po

04:47:47.900 --> 04:47:49.000
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ordinary empleyado.

04:47:49.140 --> 04:48:02.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Hindi po. Bilang presidente, bilang CFO, bilang CEO, bilang treasurer, pwede po po siyang tumanggap ng sweldo? Pwede po. Pwede po. Kaya hindi nga po mababang empleyado pinag-uusapan lang.

04:48:02.279 --> 04:48:02.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi

04:48:02.280 --> 04:48:03.020
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po mababang empleyado.

04:48:03.200 --> 04:48:07.440
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: At yung sweldo ang tinatanggap niya, yun po yung subject to withholding tax kung saka-saka na.

04:48:07.520 --> 04:48:08.260
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

04:48:08.480 --> 04:48:15.410
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay. Senator-Judge Raffy Tulfo is recognized for... The last question for today, according to Anika.

04:48:18.040 --> 04:48:24.840
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Actually, follow up ito sa question mo. Sa prosecution tatanong ko ito.

04:48:27.400 --> 04:48:37.950
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Since alam naman natin lahat ngayon na bawal sa isang vice president na magmay-ari ng isang negosyo, whether yan ay kumita o hindi. Halimbawa, kumita yung mga negosyo na iyon.

04:48:39.520 --> 04:48:52.820
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Or sabi natin in some cases, sabi nga dito sa pinakita sa atin ngayon, walang kita, negative. Pero tumatanggap siya ng sweldo sa mga kumpanya ngayon as chairman o kuha namang pwesto niya. Would that be considered ill-gotten wealth?

04:48:55.390 --> 04:49:11.150
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If I may, Senator-Judge Raffy, the prosecutor might be compelled in answering your question to make a conclusion of law. on the matter, which they should prove and not make conclusions on.

04:49:11.930 --> 04:49:29.690
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So ang tanong ko nalang siguro, meron ba kayo mga dokumento aside from pinakita nyo dito ngayon that will show na kumikita yung kumpanya na pagmamayari ni VP Sara at ni Hans, at ni Mans Carpio.

04:49:31.640 --> 04:49:35.940
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: I'm sorry? Mans, sorry. Mans Carpio, excuse me.

04:49:36.330 --> 04:50:01.570
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So sir, based po sa SEC records meron pong financial statements yung mga kumpanya at dito po makikita kung kumikita o nalulugi yung kumpanya and we will also be presenting representatives from the BIR which will be showing yung income tax returns din po ng mga kumpanyang ito at doon din po natin makikita kung kumikita o nalulugi po yung mga kumpanya. So

04:50:01.570 --> 04:50:24.860
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: last na lang ano, sabi nga kanina yung presiding officer, So, pwedeng tumanggap ng sweldo, Mr. Witness, ang chairman of the board or board of director ng isang kumpanya, it doesn't stop him or her to accept salaries or allowances for that matter.

04:50:25.470 --> 04:50:35.790
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang ayon po sa batas. Kung meron pong provision sa kanilang bylaws na pwede silang tumanggap ng compensation, pwede po. At yun ay dapat maideklara.

04:50:39.220 --> 04:50:45.160
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Alam ko po lahat po nang tatanggapin mong sweldo, pera ay dapat mong i-deklara kung ito ay income.

04:50:56.220 --> 04:50:58.100
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, just a quick manifestation.

04:50:58.520 --> 04:51:05.200
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, Attorney Erwin, before we call it a day and before the Chair makes a ruling with respect to the motion to strike of the Honorable Ridon.

04:51:05.320 --> 04:51:32.670
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: This is just an administrative matter, Your Honor. For the record, we will be requesting for the marking of the summary of the shareholdings and the financial information. We will request that this be marked as a prosecution's P-R2-2- 7-1, as well as the Summary of Incorporators and Shareholders which will be marking as Exhibit P-R2-2-7-2.

04:51:33.870 --> 04:51:35.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Noted and let it be so, Mark.

04:51:36.320 --> 04:51:41.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you, Your Honor. And may I turn over the rostrum to our two Congressmen?

04:51:41.120 --> 04:51:51.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes. Now, acting on the motion of earlier to strike of, I have the TSN with me now, of the Honorable Ridon, I'm sure would like to quote,

04:51:53.270 --> 04:52:21.330
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: From TSN. Forgive me, there's no pagination yet. Quote from Attorney Justin. And the quick perusal of the documents already shows some misrepresentation, Your Honor. For example, the summary is labeled as a summary of Vice President Sara's shareholdings. Chair orders the word misrepresentation stricken from the record and replaced with the word inaccuracies. Attorney Justin? Justin, rather.

04:52:21.790 --> 04:52:23.570
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: We submit, Your Honor, to the court's discretion.

04:52:24.290 --> 04:53:14.230
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Next, with respect to the phrase, again, I do not have the page number since there is no pagination yet. Attorney Justin, and this is precisely why we need to object, Your Honor. Clearly, this is again an attempt and apologies to use the term to condition the mind of the public over these figures that will be flashed, Your Honor. Chair rules to delete the Word and after the word attempt, forgive me if I'm sounding like I'm amending a bill, up to the word of before the word the. I don't have the lines and to replace it with to make conclusions of fact to so that it shall read. Your Honor, clearly this is again an attempt to make conclusions of fact to the public over these figures that will be flashed, Your Honor. Attorney Justin?

04:53:14.690 --> 04:53:17.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: The same comment, Your Honor. We submit to the court's wisdom, Your Honor. So

04:53:17.670 --> 04:53:17.870
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: ruled.

