Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Honorable Ridon, you have your witnesses ready?

04:53:24.200 --> 04:53:27.640
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Yes, Your Honor. Itatakda lang po namin yung pagkakasunod-sunod na po.

04:53:29.270 --> 04:53:47.040
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Para bukas, September 22, 2026, si PhilGEPS Division Chief, Mr. Rendell Sopeña po yung isasalang po sa witness stand. Para po dun sa tatlong nalalabi pong mga testigo,

04:53:48.670 --> 04:53:54.010
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: We are requesting your honor na sa susunod na linggo na lang po sila, isa lang. And when

04:53:54.010 --> 04:53:55.490
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: will you make the manifestation?

04:53:57.570 --> 04:54:01.670
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Can you make the manifestation by tomorrow so that we can issue the subpoenas also by tomorrow?

04:54:01.670 --> 04:54:01.790
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: We

04:54:01.790 --> 04:54:34.240
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: will make it now in open court, your honor. Please proceed. Yung pong pagkakasunod-sunod ay Davao City Mayor, Hon. Sebastian Z. Duterte. Ikalawa, PhilHealth Regional Office 11, BAC Secretariat. Atty. Gary Samonte. At ikatlo po, PNP Firearms and Explosives Office, Records Division Chief, Police Major, Joe Rickson Sanggalang. Para po ito sa September 28 to 30, Your Honor.

04:54:36.680 --> 04:54:37.160
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Um...

04:54:38.890 --> 04:54:40.450
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Sanggalang.

04:54:43.660 --> 04:54:45.600
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Doon po sa... Sorry, Your Honor.

04:54:45.600 --> 04:54:46.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: In that order?

04:54:46.540 --> 04:54:55.700
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Yes, correct, Your Honor. At hindi lang po ito para sa testimonya, kundi para rin po ito para sa mga dokumento. Yan lang po. Maraming salamat.

04:55:19.060 --> 04:55:32.740
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: and orders the Clerk of Court to issue the corresponding subpoenas for Mayor Duterte, Atty. Samonte, and Major Sanggalang on September

04:55:35.070 --> 04:55:42.510
